The '''Bat Person Artifact''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessory]] that grants {{Stat|def|+10}}, alongside increased {{stat|str}} and {{Stat|intelligence}} for each bat that is summoned. It is the upgraded version of the {{Item|Bat Person Ring}} and is the final accessory in the Bat Person line.

